Before any task, read `CLAUDE.md` (project summary, invariants, verified constants) and `PROGRESS.md` (task board).
Build contracts exactly to `docs/CONTRACTS_SPEC.md`. Check `docs/DECISIONS.md` before changing a design choice.
Hard rules: SmartOSM.peek() never returns has=false or 0 after init; repayments are never blocked; never change Spotter.mat; ilk is "paxg"; never modify Multipli core contracts.
After finishing a task, tick it in `PROGRESS.md` and add a session-log line.
